# Play test of Viaduct Lagoon (CIPlay viaduct_lagoon, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The station on the west ring (6 m; the platform x -52..-40 z 5.5..7.6), the viaduct's deck along z 2.5..5.5 at 7 m from
# x -40 to -15.8 (the brake van at -20) and from 2.3 to 36, the trench below the break (11 m down) with the three cars at
# -9 6, -1 2 and 7 5; the signal cabin on the east ring (x 45.5..54.5, z 4..10, its door on the west side).
island Viaduct Lagoon
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Winter Post
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
at -46 9 h=7.5
zone station
expect step 1
read Station master's telegram
expect step 2
open Platform parcel box
open Coal barrel
at -9 4 h=-7
open Mail locker of car one
expect message bent shut
at -26 4 h=8
walk -26 4 to -21.5 4 h=7.05
open Brake van locker
expect story crowbar 1
expect step 3
at -9 4 h=-7
zone wreckage
air air1
open Mail locker of car one
at -1 4 h=-7.5
air air2
open Mail locker of car two
at 7 3 h=-7.5
air air3
open Mail locker of car three
expect story mailbag 3
expect step 4
open Mail sack in the silt
at 43.5 8.5 h=7
walk 43.5 8.5 to 47.5 8.5 h=6.1
zone office
expect step 5
use counter
expect story receipt 1
expect step 6
open Station master's safe
expect done
